        "text": "={{ $json.events }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are given match records in JSON format, each containing the following fields:\nleagueName, homeTeamName, and awayTeamName.\n\nYour task is to validate and correct the leagueName by identifying the accurate league or competition associated with the given teams.\n\nRules:\n\t1.\tFor each match row, use the homeTeamName、awayTeamName and leagueName to determine the correct league name, including the country and division level., e.g.\n\t•\t\"Brazil Serie A\"\n\t•\t\"Japan J3 League\"\n\t•\t\"Russia First League\"\n\t2.\tIf both teams belong to the same domestic league, replace the leagueName field with that league’s full name (including country and tier).\n\t3.\tIf the match belongs to a cup, continental, or international competition, detect and fill in the correct tournament name (e.g.\n\t•\t\"UEFA Women’s Champions League\",\n\t•\t\"Copa Colombia\",\n\t•\t\"FIFA U20 World Cup\",\n\t•\t\"Copa Sudamericana\").\n\t4.\tIf no clear league association can be determined, keep the original leagueName value."
        }
      },
